    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against alien flying objects across the universe and defend the earth against menacing green alien smoke. Tight gameplay loop, tight controls and multiplayer support. Join Earth Space Defenders today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a twin stick spaceship game where the player plays arena like short missions each consisting of few waves of alien ships. There are 100 different levels in 20 chapters. Missions tell the story of battle against green alien smoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing a mission gives an upgrade card. You can repeat the mission to get more cards, but only one can be selected from each mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer support both locally with controllers and with Steam friends online. You can also combine these.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against alien flying objects across the universe and defend the earth against menacing green alien smoke. Tight gameplay loop, tight controls and multiplayer support. Join Earth Space Defenders today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a twin stick spaceship game where the player plays arena like short missions each consisting of few waves of alien ships. There are 100 different levels in 20 chapters. Missions tell the story of battle against green alien smoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing a mission gives an upgrade card. You can repeat the mission to get more cards, but only one can be selected from each mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer support both locally with controllers and with Steam friends online. You can also combine these.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Earth Space Defenders is a starship twin-stick real-time shooter action game. Experience story of menacing green smoke that plagues whole universe. Supports steam multiplayer and party play with multiple controllers.",
